{"start": 2.66, "end": 3.64, "text": "That'd be the best.", "p": -0.2763671800494194, "nospeech": 0.264404296875, "words": [[2.66, 3.18, " That'd", 0.32], [3.18, 3.26, " be", 1.0], [3.26, 3.34, " the", 0.8], [3.34, 3.64, " best.", 0.99]]}
{"start": 24.57, "end": 26.15, "text": "Well, if he's going to Bangor,", "p": -0.2763671800494194, "nospeech": 0.264404296875, "words": [[24.57, 25.09, " Well,", 0.26], [25.15, 25.23, " if", 0.92], [25.23, 25.39, " he's", 0.86], [25.39, 25.51, " going", 0.99], [25.51, 25.65, " to", 0.99], [25.65, 26.15, " Bangor,", 0.99]]}
{"start": 26.23, "end": 28.71, "text": "are these guys going to Bangor? One's going to Bangor.", "p": -0.2763671800494194, "nospeech": 0.264404296875, "words": [[26.23, 26.33, " are", 0.89], [26.33, 26.43, " these", 1.0], [26.43, 26.67, " guys", 0.99], [26.67, 26.89, " going", 0.38], [26.89, 27.09, " to", 0.99], [27.09, 27.51, " Bangor?", 1.0], [27.69, 28.01, " One's", 0.64], [28.01, 28.15, " going", 1.0], [28.15, 28.29, " to", 1.0], [28.29, 28.71, " Bangor.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 37.22, "end": 38.26, "text": "FAA again.", "p": -0.2763671800494194, "nospeech": 0.264404296875, "words": [[37.22, 37.74, " FAA", 0.49], [37.74, 38.26, " again.", 0.9]]}
{"start": 39.56, "end": 42.34, "text": "Hi, Caroline. Cleveland Center Military again.", "p": -0.2763671800494194, "nospeech": 0.264404296875, "words": [[39.56, 40.08, " Hi,", 0.85], [40.2, 40.46, " Caroline.", 0.95], [40.8, 41.32, " Cleveland", 0.97], [41.32, 41.6, " Center", 0.93], [41.6, 41.86, " Military", 0.78], [41.86, 42.34, " again.", 0.96]]}
{"start": 42.34, "end": 48.74, "text": "And, exactly, you told me that you scrambled airplanes out of Selfridge and Toledo.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[42.34, 42.34, " And,", 0.02], [42.48, 43.68, " exactly,", 0.47], [44.04, 45.32, " you", 1.0], [45.32, 45.88, " told", 1.0], [45.88, 46.1, " me", 1.0], [46.1, 46.3, " that", 0.99], [46.3, 46.44, " you", 1.0], [46.44, 46.8, " scrambled", 0.99], [46.8, 47.12, " airplanes", 0.99], [47.12, 47.6, " out", 1.0], [47.6, 47.74, " of", 1.0], [47.74, 48.18, " Selfridge", 0.98], [48.18, 48.38, " and", 0.99], [48.38, 48.74, " Toledo.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 48.8, "end": 49.2, "text": "Is that correct?", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[48.8, 48.96, " Is", 1.0], [48.96, 49.0, " that", 1.0], [49.0, 49.2, " correct?", 1.0]]}
{"start": 49.75, "end": 50.49, "text": "Yes, that's correct.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[49.75, 50.15, " Yes,", 0.96], [50.15, 50.49, " that's", 0.97], [50.49, 50.49, " correct.", 0.74]]}
{"start": 50.57, "end": 51.23, "text": "Sir, that is correct.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[50.57, 50.73, " Sir,", 0.96], [50.73, 50.85, " that", 1.0], [50.85, 50.97, " is", 1.0], [50.97, 51.23, " correct.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 51.35, "end": 52.47, "text": "Selfridge and Toledo.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[51.35, 51.75, " Selfridge", 1.0], [51.75, 52.07, " and", 1.0], [52.07, 52.47, " Toledo.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 52.65, "end": 53.05, "text": "Okay.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[52.65, 53.05, " Okay.", 0.97]]}
{"start": 53.13, "end": 54.35, "text": "They are up in the air now.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[53.13, 53.31, " They", 1.0], [53.31, 53.45, " are", 1.0], [53.45, 53.69, " up", 1.0], [53.69, 53.83, " in", 1.0], [53.83, 53.93, " the", 1.0], [53.93, 54.13, " air", 1.0], [54.13, 54.35, " now.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 54.97, "end": 55.87, "text": "Standby one, sir.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[54.97, 55.37, " Standby", 0.8], [55.37, 55.55, " one,", 0.83], [55.65, 55.87, " sir.", 0.98]]}
{"start": 55.97, "end": 57.41, "text": "I will ask the mission crew commander.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[55.97, 56.21, " I", 1.0], [56.21, 56.41, " will", 1.0], [56.41, 56.63, " ask", 1.0], [56.63, 56.77, " the", 1.0], [56.77, 56.91, " mission", 0.96], [56.91, 57.11, " crew", 1.0], [57.11, 57.41, " commander.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 57.61, "end": 57.99, "text": "Standby.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[57.61, 57.99, " Standby.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 60.72, "end": 61.98, "text": "Are they still up?", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[60.72, 61.12, " Are", 0.96], [61.12, 61.52, " they", 1.0], [61.52, 61.78, " still", 1.0], [61.78, 61.98, " up?", 1.0]]}
{"start": 64.71, "end": 66.81, "text": "So far, we think that's affirmative, sir.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[64.71, 65.11, " So", 1.0], [65.11, 65.33, " far,", 1.0], [65.37, 65.53, " we", 1.0], [65.53, 65.95, " think", 1.0], [65.95, 66.15, " that's", 1.0], [66.15, 66.41, " affirmative,", 1.0], [66.57, 66.81, " sir.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 67.15, "end": 68.21, "text": "Is there anything you need?", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[67.15, 67.55, " Is", 1.0], [67.55, 67.67, " there", 1.0], [67.67, 67.83, " anything", 1.0], [67.83, 68.07, " you", 1.0], [68.07, 68.21, " need?", 1.0]]}
{"start": 70.0, "end": 70.4, "text": "Okay.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[70.0, 70.4, " Okay.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 70.44, "end": 73.2, "text": "I just wanted to confirm that they did say.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[70.44, 70.68, " I", 1.0], [70.68, 70.86, " just", 1.0], [70.86, 71.06, " wanted", 1.0], [71.06, 71.2, " to", 1.0], [71.2, 71.46, " confirm", 1.0], [71.46, 71.84, " that", 1.0], [71.84, 72.84, " they", 0.95], [72.84, 73.04, " did", 1.0], [73.04, 73.2, " say.", 0.79]]}
{"start": 73.24, "end": 74.04, "text": "Do you know how many?", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[73.24, 73.5, " Do", 0.98], [73.5, 73.58, " you", 1.0], [73.58, 73.68, " know", 1.0], [73.68, 73.78, " how", 1.0], [73.78, 74.04, " many?", 1.0]]}
{"start": 74.52, "end": 75.44, "text": "I think there's four.", "p": -0.2437499941388766, "nospeech": 0.406005859375, "words": [[74.52, 74.92, " I", 1.0], [74.92, 75.06, " think", 1.0], [75.06, 75.26, " there's", 1.0], [75.26, 75.44, " four.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 75.44, "end": 76.92, "text": "But stand by, sir. We're going to check for shore.", "p": -0.36562501080334187, "nospeech": 0.3369140625, "words": [[75.44, 75.56, " But", 0.13], [75.56, 75.78, " stand", 0.6], [75.78, 75.94, " by,", 0.95], [75.98, 76.12, " sir.", 0.99], [76.14, 76.28, " We're", 0.99], [76.28, 76.3, " going", 0.96], [76.3, 76.34, " to", 1.0], [76.34, 76.56, " check", 1.0], [76.56, 76.72, " for", 0.98], [76.72, 76.92, " shore.", 0.81]]}
{"start": 86.19, "end": 87.27, "text": "Yes, sir, they're still up.", "p": -0.36562501080334187, "nospeech": 0.3369140625, "words": [[86.19, 86.55, " Yes,", 0.98], [86.55, 86.69, " sir,", 1.0], [86.73, 86.83, " they're", 1.0], [86.83, 87.05, " still", 1.0], [87.05, 87.27, " up.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 87.83, "end": 88.75, "text": "Okay, thank you.", "p": -0.36562501080334187, "nospeech": 0.3369140625, "words": [[87.83, 88.19, " Okay,", 0.93], [88.25, 88.55, " thank", 1.0], [88.55, 88.75, " you.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 88.87, "end": 89.43, "text": "You're welcome, sir.", "p": -0.36562501080334187, "nospeech": 0.3369140625, "words": [[88.87, 89.05, " You're", 0.95], [89.05, 89.21, " welcome,", 1.0], [89.27, 89.43, " sir.", 0.98]]}
{"start": 132.62, "end": 132.98, "text": "FAA.", "p": -0.36562501080334187, "nospeech": 0.3369140625, "words": [[132.62, 132.98, " FAA.", 0.67]]}
{"start": 134.56, "end": 135.82, "text": "Huntress ID, Sergeant LeBlanc.", "p": -0.36562501080334187, "nospeech": 0.3369140625, "words": [[134.56, 134.92, " Huntress", 0.87], [134.92, 135.16, " ID,", 0.8], [135.3, 135.48, " Sergeant", 0.87], [135.48, 135.82, " LeBlanc.", 0.88]]}
{"start": 137.26, "end": 138.42, "text": "Huntress ID, answer your line.", "p": -0.36562501080334187, "nospeech": 0.3369140625, "words": [[137.26, 137.62, " Huntress", 1.0], [137.62, 137.82, " ID,", 0.94], [137.88, 138.04, " answer", 0.87], [138.04, 138.22, " your", 0.82], [138.22, 138.42, " line.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 138.92, "end": 140.3, "text": "Huntress, this is Cleveland Center.", "p": -0.36562501080334187, "nospeech": 0.3369140625, "words": [[138.92, 139.28, " Huntress,", 1.0], [139.32, 139.52, " this", 1.0], [139.52, 139.68, " is", 1.0], [139.68, 140.02, " Cleveland", 1.0], [140.02, 140.3, " Center.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 140.3, "end": 142.04, "text": "Senator, can I speak to the mission commander, please?", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[140.3, 140.42, " Senator,", 0.06], [140.42, 140.54, " can", 0.97], [140.54, 140.64, " I", 0.99], [140.64, 140.84, " speak", 1.0], [140.84, 141.02, " to", 0.99], [141.02, 141.12, " the", 0.99], [141.12, 141.3, " mission", 0.66], [141.3, 141.72, " commander,", 0.98], [141.82, 142.04, " please?", 1.0]]}
{"start": 142.14, "end": 142.82, "text": "Yes, sir. Stand by.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[142.14, 142.3, " Yes,", 0.96], [142.3, 142.46, " sir.", 0.99], [142.46, 142.66, " Stand", 0.99], [142.66, 142.82, " by.", 0.95]]}
{"start": 144.78, "end": 145.54, "text": "On the ground.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[144.78, 145.18, " On", 0.91], [145.18, 145.28, " the", 1.0], [145.28, 145.54, " ground.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 145.76, "end": 146.16, "text": "Okay.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[145.76, 146.16, " Okay.", 0.34]]}
{"start": 146.66, "end": 147.48, "text": "On the ground.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[146.66, 147.06, " On", 1.0], [147.06, 147.22, " the", 1.0], [147.22, 147.48, " ground.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 147.78, "end": 149.6, "text": "That's what I was told.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[147.78, 148.18, " That's", 0.59], [148.18, 148.18, " what", 0.95], [148.18, 148.42, " I", 1.0], [148.42, 149.24, " was", 0.97], [149.24, 149.6, " told.", 0.98]]}
{"start": 149.7, "end": 151.16, "text": "On the ground and cancel.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[149.7, 150.1, " On", 0.73], [150.1, 150.34, " the", 1.0], [150.34, 150.58, " ground", 1.0], [150.58, 150.76, " and", 0.99], [150.76, 151.16, " cancel.", 0.83]]}
{"start": 153.06, "end": 156.58, "text": "Major, this is Tom Karenko, Cleveland Center.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[153.06, 153.46, " Major,", 0.97], [153.62, 153.68, " this", 0.64], [153.68, 153.78, " is", 1.0], [153.78, 155.32, " Tom", 0.98], [155.32, 155.84, " Karenko,", 0.68], [155.98, 156.24, " Cleveland", 1.0], [156.24, 156.58, " Center.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 156.8, "end": 157.26, "text": "Hello, Tom.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[156.8, 157.0, " Hello,", 1.0], [157.06, 157.26, " Tom.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 157.38, "end": 160.0, "text": "Hey, listen, we're getting all kinds of planes out of the sky,", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[157.38, 157.72, " Hey,", 1.0], [157.72, 157.92, " listen,", 1.0], [158.06, 158.22, " we're", 1.0], [158.22, 158.38, " getting", 1.0], [158.38, 158.54, " all", 1.0], [158.54, 158.72, " kinds", 1.0], [158.72, 158.98, " of", 1.0], [158.98, 159.18, " planes", 1.0], [159.18, 159.44, " out", 1.0], [159.44, 159.6, " of", 1.0], [159.6, 159.66, " the", 1.0], [159.66, 160.0, " sky,", 1.0]]}
{"start": 160.14, "end": 163.46, "text": "and you folks are having them launched, and we don't know anything about it.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[160.14, 160.38, " and", 1.0], [160.38, 160.62, " you", 1.0], [160.62, 160.88, " folks", 1.0], [160.88, 161.12, " are", 1.0], [161.12, 161.4, " having", 1.0], [161.4, 161.54, " them", 1.0], [161.54, 161.92, " launched,", 1.0], [161.98, 162.16, " and", 1.0], [162.16, 162.24, " we", 1.0], [162.24, 162.46, " don't", 1.0], [162.46, 162.58, " know", 1.0], [162.58, 162.8, " anything", 1.0], [162.8, 163.16, " about", 1.0], [163.16, 163.46, " it.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 163.58, "end": 167.66, "text": "We need you to have somebody call over here and give us some codes when they come off.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[163.58, 163.98, " We", 1.0], [163.98, 164.18, " need", 1.0], [164.18, 164.36, " you", 1.0], [164.36, 164.46, " to", 1.0], [164.46, 164.6, " have", 1.0], [164.6, 164.98, " somebody", 1.0], [164.98, 165.28, " call", 1.0], [165.28, 165.52, " over", 1.0], [165.52, 165.82, " here", 1.0], [165.82, 165.96, " and", 1.0], [165.96, 166.1, " give", 1.0], [166.1, 166.26, " us", 1.0], [166.26, 166.46, " some", 1.0], [166.46, 166.8, " codes", 1.0], [166.8, 167.1, " when", 1.0], [167.1, 167.22, " they", 1.0], [167.22, 167.4, " come", 1.0], [167.4, 167.66, " off.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 167.86, "end": 168.16, "text": "Will do.", "p": -0.24196428401129585, "nospeech": 0.36181640625, "words": [[167.86, 168.06, " Will", 0.93], [168.06, 168.16, " do.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 168.16, "end": 170.64, "text": "We heard that you just had two depart off Pittsburgh.", "p": -0.1677852384996094, "nospeech": 0.63037109375, "words": [[168.16, 168.44, " We", 0.2], [168.44, 168.76, " heard", 0.86], [168.76, 168.96, " that", 0.81], [168.96, 169.1, " you", 0.99], [169.1, 169.28, " just", 0.88], [169.28, 169.46, " had", 0.96], [169.46, 169.7, " two", 0.77], [169.7, 170.0, " depart", 0.94], [170.0, 170.26, " off", 0.95], [170.26, 170.64, " Pittsburgh.", 0.76]]}
{"start": 171.2, "end": 174.98, "text": "Uh, my understanding, you had two, what, two, uh, military?", "p": -0.1677852384996094, "nospeech": 0.63037109375, "words": [[171.2, 171.6, " Uh,", 0.28], [171.92, 172.28, " my", 0.84], [172.28, 172.56, " understanding,", 0.89], [172.74, 173.02, " you", 0.95], [173.02, 173.22, " had", 0.98], [173.22, 173.54, " two,", 0.96], [173.66, 173.88, " what,", 1.0], [173.94, 174.18, " two,", 0.99], [174.34, 174.62, " uh,", 0.99], [174.62, 174.98, " military?", 0.98]]}
{"start": 175.36, "end": 177.02, "text": "Two KC-135s.", "p": -0.1677852384996094, "nospeech": 0.63037109375, "words": [[175.36, 175.62, " Two", 0.98], [175.62, 176.06, " KC", 1.0], [176.06, 177.02, "-135s.", 0.99]]}
{"start": 177.04, "end": 184.22, "text": "Yeah. Okay, I can have my, uh, uh, senior director give you a call every time somebody's gone up in here.", "p": -0.1677852384996094, "nospeech": 0.63037109375, "words": [[177.04, 177.28, " Yeah.", 0.98], [177.8, 178.2, " Okay,", 0.98], [178.32, 178.44, " I", 1.0], [178.44, 178.64, " can", 1.0], [178.64, 178.78, " have", 1.0], [178.78, 179.24, " my,", 1.0], [179.24, 179.6, " uh,", 1.0], [180.28, 180.34, " uh,", 0.87], [180.56, 181.04, " senior", 0.91], [181.04, 181.34, " director", 1.0], [181.34, 181.72, " give", 1.0], [181.72, 181.92, " you", 1.0], [181.92, 182.04, " a", 1.0], [182.04, 182.28, " call", 1.0], [182.28, 182.7, " every", 0.98], [182.7, 182.94, " time", 1.0], [182.94, 183.36, " somebody's", 1.0], [183.36, 183.48, " gone", 0.9], [183.48, 183.94, " up", 0.86], [183.94, 184.08, " in", 0.99], [184.08, 184.22, " here.", 1.0]]}
{"start": 184.34, "end": 188.74, "text": "I can give you a quick, uh, heads up, though. I got two, you know the Misty Thunder area?", "p": -0.1677852384996094, "nospeech": 0.63037109375, "words": [[184.34, 184.7, " I", 0.97], [184.7, 184.86, " can", 0.73], [184.86, 185.0, " give", 1.0], [185.0, 185.1, " you", 1.0], [185.1, 185.18, " a", 1.0], [185.18, 185.4, " quick,", 1.0], [185.42, 185.66, " uh,", 1.0], [185.78, 186.08, " heads", 1.0], [186.08, 186.3, " up,", 0.9], [186.3, 186.48, " though.", 1.0], [186.72, 187.12, " I", 1.0], [187.12, 187.28, " got", 1.0], [187.28, 187.64, " two,", 1.0], [187.66, 187.8, " you", 1.0], [187.8, 187.9, " know", 1.0], [187.9, 187.98, " the", 0.48], [187.98, 188.26, " Misty", 0.99], [188.26, 188.42, " Thunder", 1.0], [188.42, 188.74, " area?", 1.0]]}
{"start": 188.98, "end": 190.62, "text": "Yeah. I got three up there now.", "p": -0.1677852384996094, "nospeech": 0.63037109375, "words": [[188.98, 189.16, " Yeah.", 0.99], [189.2, 189.48, " I", 0.11], [189.48, 189.64, " got", 0.95], [189.64, 189.98, " three", 0.99], [189.98, 190.22, " up", 1.0], [190.22, 190.42, " there", 1.0], [190.42, 190.62, " now.", 1.0]]}
